{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This game does NOT use any models from any other site. This game includes original models made by me and SXP.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, alright, let me break it down for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a new job, a pristine new mall, and a terrifying new reality. You just landed the job of a night shift security guard at an overhyped and pretty garbage mall that's about to open in a week from now. Think it'll be easy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope. It won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got a guy in a black jacket + blue shirt fit named Nate on his way to your office to kill you, and <strong>you can't run, you can only hide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some tools you can use to survive! <strong>(and by you can use, I mean YOU HAVE TO USE)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb Camera feed that malfunctions every now and then</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa Closet with limited oxygen; Plan carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Some pretty good looking visuals.. right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd21 and your annoying boss who calls you every night just to piss you off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really, not more than that. Let's make something clear though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got<strong> five</strong>\u00a0nights,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>one</strong>\u00a0job,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and<strong> ZERO</strong>\u00a0backup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Night Shift at Nate's, the horror game that 100% deserves to be on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the shift, survive the night. Do you think you got what it takes?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beat Night One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/0ae92da9ccfff668c9cc6761d4b4c457d7cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Night Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/0ae92da9ccfff668c9cc6761d4b4c457d7cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Night Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/0ae92da9ccfff668c9cc6761d4b4c457d7cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Night Four","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/0ae92da9ccfff668c9cc6761d4b4c457d7cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Night Five","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/0ae92da9ccfff668c9cc6761d4b4c457d7cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Foreshadowing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884050/eb6f5a9071a64a3316b372121f897e80109abd71.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884050?t=1766462276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884050?t=1766462276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884050/5e3888621a51997cc8fa6b520934f761587a8a86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766462276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884050/5e3888621a51997cc8fa6b520934f761587a8a86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766462276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descript